          "body_text": "<p>Behind every jar is a story that started long before we ever thought about selling anything. This authentic Mexican chile oil began as a generations-old family recipe. </p><p>A smoky, handcrafted salsa macha passed down quietly and shared only with the people we love.</p><p>We brought it to America because a flavor this real deserves a bigger table. Every small-batch jar is still made the same way it always has been: wholesome, all-natural ingredients, real dried chiles, and the kind of care that no mass-produced condiment can replicate. </p><p>One taste was all it took for everyone to agree: <em>the flavor is simply incomparable.</em>And the best part? The most delicious dishes are still ahead of you.</p>"
